# JVM crash dumps. They appear beside the pom when a JVM runs out of memory (running the
# test suite next to the Compose stack will do it), they are large, and a replay/crash dump
# holds whatever was in that process's memory — so never commit one.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
